usage: run_ctl.py [-h] [--sim] [--ver] [--debug] [--load] config

positional arguments:
  config      Path to YAML config.

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
  --sim       Run trajectory simulation.
  --ver       Run reachability analysis.
  --debug     Enable debug mode.
  --load      Load results from output directory instead of running.
